    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You turn 1 bulk of inert matter, such as debris, dust, rocks, or other unattended 0-level items, into 1 bulk of junked electronic equipment suitable for targeting with spells such as @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.j6s8awSNQrtd9eA3]{Battle Junkbot}, @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.TQV8YIT3HlhSszMr]{Handy Junkbot}, @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.J9H196LxSVvMguhe]{Healing Junkbot}, @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.eemr4YD0xuzF67Zq]{Junk Armor}, or @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.spells.Item.T4uX647wYIcHS8rj]{Junksword}. The junked electronics have no resale value and cannot be repaired into any functioning item. Any direct examination by a character trained in Engineering or Physical Science reveals the useless nature of the junk.</p>"
    },
